\\\ 4A & =6-4+\\frac{2}{5} \\\\ 4A & =\\frac{10+2}{5} \\\\ A & =\\frac{12}{20} \\\\ A & =\\frac{3}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write the integrand as the partial sum\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}-2x-5}{{x}^{2}(x-5)}=\\frac{3}{5x}+\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}+\\frac{2}{5(x-5)}.\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate this expression term by term to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{x}^{2}-2x-5}{{x}^{2}(x-5)}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (\\frac{3}{5x}+\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}+\\frac{2}{5(x-5)})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{5}\\int \\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x+\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x+\\frac{2}{5}\\int \\frac{1}{x-5}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{5}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|-\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{2}{5}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-5|+K,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $K$ is an integral constant." 13194139535275 true] [17592186341146 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341147 13194139535275 true] [17592186341146 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341148 13194139535275 true] [17592186341146 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341149 13194139535275 true] [17592186341146 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341150 13194139535275 true] [17592186341146 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341151 13194139535275 true] [17592186341146 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535275 true] [17592186341146 1041 "selection" 13194139535275 true] [17592186341146 1104 #edb/ref 17592186341148 13194139535275 true] [17592186341146 1110 #uuid "fcd62682-e831-583e-8986-092603e9e534" 13194139535275 true] [17592186341147 1034 "\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}+\\frac{2}{5}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+\\frac{2}{5}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-5|+K" 13194139535275 true] [17592186341147 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535275 true] [17592186341147 1111 #uuid "f573cc64-d267-5858-8999-94a62c406ede" 13194139535275 true] [17592186341148 1034 "\\frac{3}{5}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|-\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{2}{5}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-5|+K" 13194139535275 true] [17592186341148 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535275 true] [17592186341148 1111 #uuid "8f365832-86e4-5baa-9516-d3de574eeab5" 13194139535275 true] [17592186341149 1034