C,$ we can solve for $B:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(0)^{2} & =A(0-3)^{2}+B(0-3)(0-2)+C(0-2) \\\\ 0 & =9A+6B-2C \\\\ 0 & =9(4)+6B-2(9) \\\\ 0 & =18+6B \\\\ -6B & =18 \\\\ B & =-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(x-2)(x-3)^{2}}=\\frac{4}{x-2}-\\frac{3}{x-3}+\\frac{9}{(x-3)^{2}}.\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate this expression term by term, and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{x}^{2}}{(x-2)(x-3)^{2}}\\text{d}x & =\\int (\\frac{4}{x-2}-\\frac{3}{x-3}+\\frac{9}{(x-3)^{2}})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4\\int \\frac{1}{x-2}\\,\\text{d}x-3\\int \\frac{1}{x-3}\\,\\text{d}x+9\\int \\frac{1}{(x-3)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-2|-3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-3|-\\frac{9}{x-3}+K,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $K$ is an integral constant." 13194139535275 true] [17592186341153 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341154 13194139535275 true] [17592186341153 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341155 13194139535275 true] [17592186341153 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341156 13194139535275 true] [17592186341153 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341157 13194139535275 true] [17592186341153 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341158 13194139535275 true] [17592186341153 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535275 true] [17592186341153 1041 "selection" 13194139535275 true] [17592186341153 1104 #edb/ref 17592186341155 13194139535275 true] [17592186341153 1110 #uuid "731ab4af-fa85-5905-ab15-314657743ef8" 13194139535275 true] [17592186341154 1034 "4\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-2|-3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-3|+9\\operatorname{ln}⁡|(x-3)^{2}|+K" 13194139535275 true] [17592186341154 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535275 true] [17592186341154 1111 #uuid "ad5ad403-f4a0-5a5a-80e6-ba2c928db9a0" 13194139535275 true] [17592186341155 1034 "4\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-2|-3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-3|-\\frac{9}{x-3}+K" 13194139535275 true] [17592186341155 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535275 true] [17592186341155 1111 #uuid "8a722181-452d-5391-9391-a9b7fb9b1a4f" 13194139535275 true] [17592186341156 1034 "4\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-2|-3\\operatornam